  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nWould _\"consume transient activation\"_ be more descriptive of [consume user activation](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#consume-user-activation) which only affects [transient activation](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#transient-activation)?\n\nRight now it takes a bit of digging to learn [sticky](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#sticky-activation) is unaffected by consumption which is conditional on: _\"if window's [last activation timestamp](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#last-activation-timestamp) is not positive infinity, ...\"_\n",
